# Compound-target (B/W mixing zone) variant of slag_w.recycle.
# S channels use 3D Y(E,theta,c_B) tables from RustBCA compound targets;
# 'conc B' keys the lookup to the local mixing-zone boron fraction (the
# composition dependence is inside the table -- no linear 'mat' weight).
# T channels: probability from 3D R(E,theta,c_B) tables (rtable ... conc B);
# outgoing spectrum still sampled from the pure TRIM tables (documented).
W --> W
T w_on_w conc B rtable w_on_bw_refl
W --> W
A 0.0
W --> W
S w_on_bw_w conc B
W --> B
S w_on_bw_b conc B
W+ --> W
T w_on_w conc B rtable w_on_bw_refl
W+ --> W
A 0.0
W+ --> W
S w_on_bw_w conc B
W+ --> B
S w_on_bw_b conc B
W2+ --> W
T w_on_w conc B rtable w_on_bw_refl
W2+ --> W
A 0.0
W2+ --> W
S w_on_bw_w conc B
W2+ --> B
S w_on_bw_b conc B
W3+ --> W
T w_on_w conc B rtable w_on_bw_refl
W3+ --> W
A 0.0
W3+ --> W
S w_on_bw_w conc B
W3+ --> B
S w_on_bw_b conc B
B --> B
T b_on_b conc B rtable b_on_bw_refl
B --> B
A 0.0
B --> W
S b_on_bw_w conc B
B --> B
S b_on_bw_b conc B
B+ --> B
T b_on_b conc B rtable b_on_bw_refl
B+ --> B
A 0.0
B+ --> W
S b_on_bw_w conc B
B+ --> B
S b_on_bw_b conc B
B2+ --> B
T b_on_b conc B rtable b_on_bw_refl
B2+ --> B
A 0.0
B2+ --> W
S b_on_bw_w conc B
B2+ --> B
S b_on_bw_b conc B
B3+ --> B
T b_on_b conc B rtable b_on_bw_refl
B3+ --> B
A 0.0
B3+ --> W
S b_on_bw_w conc B
B3+ --> B
S b_on_bw_b conc B
B4+ --> B
T b_on_b conc B rtable b_on_bw_refl
B4+ --> B
A 0.0
B4+ --> W
S b_on_bw_w conc B
B4+ --> B
S b_on_bw_b conc B
B5+ --> B
T b_on_b conc B rtable b_on_bw_refl
B5+ --> B
